      "id": "word-copia--copy-of-work",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "copia",
      "answerEn": "copy; a particular copy of a book or other work",
      "noteEn": "As a noun, copia can mean one physical or digital instance of a written, recorded, or visual work.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Tengo una copia de la novela.",
        "en": "I have a copy of the novel."
      },
      "tags": ["word", "noun", "books", "A1"]
    },
    {
      "id": "word-fallos--errors",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "fallos",
      "answerEn": "errors; mistakes",
      "noteEn": "Fallo can be an error, fault, or failure depending on context. With work such as a translation, the plural fallos names mistakes in the content.",
      "example": {
        "es": "El informe contiene varios fallos.",
        "en": "The report contains several errors."
      },
      "tags": ["word", "errors", "plural", "A2"]
    },
